<title>USA: Ohio gov names member to development finance board.</title>
<headline>Ohio gov names member to development finance board.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ohio Governor George Voinovich announced Wednesday that he has appointed Charles West of North Canton to the Development Financing Advisory Board.</p>
<p>West replaces fellow Republican John McFadden on the board, which approves all low interest, long term, fixed asset loans for companies that want to expand or relocate to Ohio.</p>
<p>West will receive expenses only during his term, which expires Dec. 31, 1999.</p>
<p>((--David Bailey, 312-408-8647))</p>
</text>
